scope: a reproducible native-image build script for StateMcp (PGO two-stage + -march=native), documented in specs/llm-agentic.md. The actual binary is already built and installed to ~/.local/bin/okay-state-mcp and registered with `claude mcp add okay-state --scope user` on this machine — this lane lands the script so the build reproduces elsewhere, not the local install itself.
